                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "Fig. 4.6: Simple household electric heating appliances (a) Electric room heater; (b) Electric stove; (c) Electric kettle; (d) Electric iron; (e) Water heating immersion rod; (f) Hair dryer"
